<title>UK: World Bank sets 500 million Danish crown eight-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 500 million Danish crown eight-year bond. [CORRECTED 14:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from 500 Danish crown)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    18.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    COP/LUX</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
